{
  "statement": "The GreenAgent emphasizes the importance of sustainability in the bookkeeping system. GRN-01 aims to minimize energy consumption through efficient algorithms, while GRN-02 promotes cloud solutions to reduce the carbon footprint. GRN-03 supports document digitization to cut paper usage significantly. GRN-04 tracks the lifecycle resource impact of features, and GRN-05 provides users with sustainability reports. GRN-06 enables carbon offsetting for transactions, and GRN-07 ensures compliance with sustainability regulations. Together, these requirements foster an environmentally responsible bookkeeping system.",
