      "ids": ["EFF-01", "GRN-01"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "The requirement for processing transactions within 2 seconds (EFF-01) may conflict with GRN-01's goal of minimizing energy consumption, as optimizing for speed can increase energy usage."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["GRN-02", "SAF-04"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Implementing cloud-based solutions (GRN-02) may introduce complexities in error handling (SAF-04), potentially impacting system reliability."
    }
